name: sim.handleProximitySensor
description: Handles (performs sensing, etc. of) a registered proximity sensor object
luaSynopsis: int res, float dist, list point, int obj, list n = sim.handleProximitySensor(int sensorHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int res, float dist, float[3] point, int obj, float[3] n = sim.handleProximitySensor(int sensorHandle)
inputs:
1. sensorHandle: handle of a proximity sensor object, or sim.handle_all or sim.handle_all_except_explicit
outputs:
1. res: 0 if nothing was detected
2. dist: distance to the detected point
3. point: array of 3 numbers indicating the relative coordinates of the detected point
4. obj: handle of the object that was detected
5. n: array of normal vector (normalized) of the detected surface. Relative to the sensor reference frame
replacedBy:
- name: handleSensor, class: proximitySensor, file: proximitySensor_handleSensor.method
- name: checkSensor, class: proximitySensor, file: proximitySensor_checkSensor.method
